WEBVTT

00:01.543 --> 00:03.920
‎FEW DAYS AGO

00:04.796 --> 00:07.215
Whether we go with our original plan
or the alternate plan,

00:07.298 --> 00:09.968
one thing that must be done at all costs...

00:10.552 --> 00:11.845
is to separate them.

00:11.928 --> 00:15.265
<i>According to footage from the battle
with Star and Stripe,</i>

00:15.348 --> 00:19.310
<i>Tomura Shigaraki's power
has easily surpassed All For One's.</i>

00:20.145 --> 00:23.314
<i>Everyone who watched the battle at Kamino</i>

00:23.398 --> 00:26.025
<i>knows about All For One's level of power.</i>

00:26.818 --> 00:29.487
<i>In addition to the attacks
using Radio Waves</i>

00:29.571 --> 00:31.614
<i>displayed during the Assault on Tartarus,</i>

00:31.698 --> 00:35.660
<i>we're also not aware of the extent to
which they're able to share their minds.</i>

00:36.411 --> 00:40.040
If both of them come at us together,
we will have no chance of winning.

00:40.665 --> 00:44.794
Then why didn't they team up
to fight against Star?

00:44.878 --> 00:49.174
To prevent Star from calling out their
names. According to New Order's rule,

00:49.758 --> 00:53.219
her tactics would've worked once
Star said the name "All For One".

00:54.721 --> 00:56.306
During this upcoming battle,

00:56.973 --> 01:00.518
<i>we will keep them
at least 10 kilometers apart.</i>

01:00.602 --> 01:04.022
<i>This is the minimum prerequisite
for our victory.</i>

01:04.105 --> 01:08.610
I'm sure the enemies will plan their moves
to prevent this from happening.

01:09.194 --> 01:10.904
That's right, Tsukauchi.

01:12.447 --> 01:15.492
<i>The terrifying and far-reaching flames
that reduce all to ashes,</i>

01:16.326 --> 01:19.662
<i>they're a threat we experienced
during training camp.</i>

01:20.955 --> 01:23.291
Once Dabi is in the vanguard,

01:24.000 --> 01:25.543
we will be forced to stop.

01:25.627 --> 01:27.337
So basically...

01:27.420 --> 01:30.256
In order to separate All For One
and Shigaraki,

01:30.340 --> 01:32.008
we'll first separate Dabi...

01:32.091 --> 01:33.593
It's not just Dabi.

01:34.385 --> 01:36.805
That's right. It's everyone.

01:40.975 --> 01:43.853
We'll split up all the main villains
and destroy each one!

01:44.437 --> 01:48.316
In order to do that,
we must lure out the enemies.

01:49.400 --> 01:52.445
<i>We will first use Young Shinso's
Brainwashing Quirk</i>

01:52.529 --> 01:54.697
<i>to have Young Aoyama draw out</i>

01:54.781 --> 01:57.075
<i>the enemy without suspicion.</i>

01:57.158 --> 02:01.454
<i>Then we will use the Troy System
in order to separate the villains.</i>

02:01.538 --> 02:05.208
<i>After that, Young Monoma
will copy Kurogiri's Warp Gate</i>

02:05.291 --> 02:07.710
<i>to scatter the villains
to their designated locations.</i>

02:08.503 --> 02:10.672
<i>Five locations are necessary
to separate them.</i>

02:11.381 --> 02:13.258
<i>Shigaraki, the most powerful villain</i>

02:13.341 --> 02:15.718
<i>will be transported
to the UA Coffin in the Sky,</i>

02:15.802 --> 02:18.555
<i>which is equipped to handle
and contain his Decay.</i>

02:19.055 --> 02:22.684
<i>Young Monoma will copy Aizawa's Erasure</i>

02:22.767 --> 02:24.894
<i>to prevent Shigaraki from using his Quirk.</i>

02:25.520 --> 02:28.273
<i>The offense will center
around Young Midoriya</i>

02:28.356 --> 02:30.859
<i>and will include Best Jeanist, Edgeshot,</i>

02:30.942 --> 02:34.154
<i>Mirko, and other high-ranking Heroes.</i>

02:34.821 --> 02:38.825
<i>All For One will be transported
to the Gunga Mountain Villa.</i>

02:39.450 --> 02:43.204
<i>A team including Endeavor and Hawks
will lead that fight.</i>

02:43.955 --> 02:48.293
<i>The madman Dabi will be sent
to Ground Zero in the Kamino Ward.</i>

02:48.793 --> 02:50.920
<i>Young Todoroki,
who can counterattack flames,</i>

02:51.004 --> 02:53.756
<i>will be placed there as well
with Endeavor's sidekicks.</i>

02:54.757 --> 02:58.011
<i>Himiko Toga is unpredictable,</i>

02:58.094 --> 03:00.930
<i>so she will be sent
to the isolated Okuto Island.</i>

03:01.014 --> 03:02.515
<i>Gang Orca will lead the fight</i>

03:02.599 --> 03:05.852
<i>with Young Uraraka and Asui,
who have experience</i>

03:05.935 --> 03:07.937
<i>with fighting Himiko in the past.</i>

03:08.605 --> 03:12.442
<i>The remaining villains will be sent
to the Takoba Stadium.</i>

03:12.525 --> 03:13.610
<i>All the other villains left behind</i>

03:14.193 --> 03:19.115
<i>will be cleaned up by the Troy System
and the Heroes on site.</i>

03:19.699 --> 03:23.828
<i>Gigantomachia is currently detained
at Jaku Hospital Ruins,</i>

03:23.912 --> 03:26.456
<i>and Kurogiri is detained
at the Central Hospital.</i>

03:27.123 --> 03:29.000
Once Shigaraki is ready to fight,

03:29.083 --> 03:32.378
All For One will most likely
make a move to reclaim them.

03:32.462 --> 03:34.714
Therefore, they will be placed
under guard.

03:34.797 --> 03:39.177
<i>Altogether, our strategy will be
taking place in these eight locations.</i>

03:40.094 --> 03:44.432
This is the plan that Tsukauchi,
Aizawa, and I came up with.

03:45.725 --> 03:49.604
It's the entire, overall strategy
for this decisive battle!

03:52.899 --> 03:56.903
ORIGINAL STORY BY KOHEI HORIKOSHI

05:26.909 --> 05:31.581
I hear that
you hate Erasure, Mr. Final Boss!

05:31.664 --> 05:33.333
Stop moving. I can't aim.

05:33.916 --> 05:38.337
<i>Although we can't make any movements,
as long as I keep contact with Monoma,</i>

05:38.421 --> 05:41.924
<i>we can resolve the issue
regarding Copy's five-minute time limit.</i>

05:42.425 --> 05:45.178
<i>With everything planned and set in place,</i>

05:45.261 --> 05:48.514
<i>we were going to use Midoriya's
One For All to take the upper hand.</i>

05:49.432 --> 05:50.349
<i>But...</i>

05:50.433 --> 05:53.811
<i>we're in trouble,
since Midoriya is not here.</i>

05:56.689 --> 05:59.192
Dynamight! What the hell is that?

05:59.275 --> 06:00.735
No idea!

06:07.575 --> 06:10.828
I thought you were a cool guy...

06:11.871 --> 06:14.791
What a disappointment,

06:15.917 --> 06:17.877
Eraser Head.

06:23.841 --> 06:25.968
What the hell is this!

06:29.388 --> 06:30.473
Phantom Thief!

06:30.556 --> 06:31.599
I'm looking!

06:31.682 --> 06:33.810
Erasure is still activated!

06:34.477 --> 06:35.853
This isn't a Quirk then?

06:36.687 --> 06:39.982
This is growth.
It's just a part of my body,

06:40.817 --> 06:43.069
similar to how hair grows

06:43.152 --> 06:46.197
or how nails grow.

06:46.781 --> 06:50.618
It's a new form acquired for humans

06:50.701 --> 06:54.455
in order to adapt the body
to the continuously evolving Quirk.

06:54.539 --> 06:57.250
This is the future society of superhumans.

06:57.333 --> 06:59.502
It's the idea of singularity
advocated by Garaki.

07:00.670 --> 07:06.008
All of you, who have turned
a blind eye to the inevitable future,

07:06.843 --> 07:08.594
will never understand.

07:15.435 --> 07:17.895
Dynamight! I agreed to join
a team in order to fight.

07:17.979 --> 07:19.272
Pull yourself together!

07:19.355 --> 07:21.983
Call me Great Explosion Murder God,
Dynamight.

07:22.066 --> 07:24.152
Why are you trying to attack head-on?

07:24.235 --> 07:27.947
- You're a little brat, aren't you?
- What?

07:28.030 --> 07:29.782
You wanna fight, little bunny?

07:29.866 --> 07:32.034
- Concentrate!
- What?

07:32.118 --> 07:33.453
You should say, "Sure"!

07:34.954 --> 07:37.206
Teacher, I'm doing everything
I should be doing.

07:37.290 --> 07:39.792
I haven't messed up! This isn't my fault!

07:39.876 --> 07:40.751
I know!

07:41.878 --> 07:43.212
<i>Those hands, though...</i>

07:43.796 --> 07:46.215
Eraser, we got a message from Midoriya!

07:46.299 --> 07:48.634
What the hell are you guys doing, Class A!

07:48.718 --> 07:50.052
Midoriya, where are you?

07:50.136 --> 07:52.889
<i>I'm so sorry. Himiko Toga got me...</i>

07:53.764 --> 07:54.974
<i>...Okuto Island...</i>

07:55.057 --> 07:56.517
Okuto Island?

07:56.601 --> 07:59.145
<i>Requesting a warp...</i>

08:01.397 --> 08:04.066
We have to use Warp Gate
to bring Midoriya here!

08:04.150 --> 08:05.276
Can't do that.

08:06.110 --> 08:08.571
<i>Monoma can only copy one Quirk at a time.</i>

08:09.155 --> 08:13.743
<i>It will take ten seconds to switch from
Erasure to Warp and bring Midoriya here.</i>

08:14.577 --> 08:16.621
<i>Eraser, you're aware, right?</i>

08:17.413 --> 08:19.415
<i>These countless hands...</i>

08:20.208 --> 08:23.836
<i>If all of them can activate Decay...</i>

08:24.462 --> 08:27.548
<i>The moment Erasure is taken away,
it's over for us.</i>

08:28.508 --> 08:31.761
I'm sorry, Midoriya,
but you'll have to get here on your own.

08:32.470 --> 08:35.014
We will try to hold Shigaraki back
until then.

08:35.640 --> 08:37.475
<i>I will make sure Deku gets there.</i>

08:39.393 --> 08:41.229
One For All is not with us,

08:41.854 --> 08:43.856
but let's win this battle without him.

08:43.940 --> 08:45.107
- Yeah.
- Okay.

08:45.942 --> 08:46.901
Yeah.

08:51.405 --> 08:53.032
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY, OKUTO ISLAND
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA, CENTRAL HOSPITAL

08:53.115 --> 08:54.325
OKUTO ISLAND

08:55.826 --> 08:57.537
<i>Approximately 200km from the mainland</i>

08:57.620 --> 09:00.331
<i>in the Pacific Ocean is Okuto Island.</i>

09:01.332 --> 09:04.418
<i>It's a southern island where the shoals
create a beautiful horizon,</i>

09:04.502 --> 09:07.088
<i>and it has been turned into a resort.</i>

09:08.256 --> 09:10.800
<i>The main attraction of the island
is the Okuto Aquarium.</i>

09:10.883 --> 09:13.344
<i>It attracts both domestic
and international tourists.</i>

09:14.011 --> 09:17.765
<i>Gang Orca, also known as Kugo Sakamata,
is the director there.</i>

09:24.397 --> 09:26.023
Watch out! Stand back!

09:34.907 --> 09:37.785
Boss! They've gotten so much stronger
since Jaku!

09:44.292 --> 09:49.171
Did All For One stuff the Nomu
with even more Quirks?

09:54.093 --> 09:57.513
The escaped convicts are here too.
Don't let your guard down!

10:00.850 --> 10:03.019
That attack reached all the way back here.

10:03.102 --> 10:04.604
Froppy, you okay?

10:05.187 --> 10:07.565
Yes. But that shock wave just now...

10:07.648 --> 10:09.859
carried away Uravity and Deku...

10:13.696 --> 10:14.905
Deku! What did Teacher say?

10:16.574 --> 10:19.410
I have to find my way there.
The fact that we can't use Warp Gate

10:19.493 --> 10:21.662
means we're in a crisis.

10:21.746 --> 10:22.830
Then hurry and...

10:26.709 --> 10:31.756
Don't go, Izuku!
I love you, so don't go away!

10:31.839 --> 10:33.174
Toga! Whoa!

10:35.635 --> 10:39.722
<i>My Danger Sense didn't activate
even when she came at me with a knife!</i>

10:41.182 --> 10:44.435
<i>Her threatening actions
aren't being recognized as a threat.</i>

10:45.394 --> 10:48.147
<i>I can't believe someone like this exists</i>

10:48.230 --> 10:50.441
<i>and has made it this far in life.</i>

10:52.109 --> 10:56.280
Himiko Toga. What do you want from me?

10:58.491 --> 10:59.408
I want you

11:00.409 --> 11:02.286
to be my boyfriend.

11:04.038 --> 11:08.209
<i>She hurts people out of pure, genuine</i>

11:09.210 --> 11:11.170
<i>affection.</i>

11:27.728 --> 11:31.899
<i>Izuku Midoriya is the ninth wielder
of One For All</i>

11:31.982 --> 11:34.693
<i>and the most important factor
in this battle.</i>

11:36.028 --> 11:38.781
<i>All For One,
who has been orchestrating things</i>

11:38.864 --> 11:41.450
<i>behind the scenes in Japan
and across the world</i>

11:41.534 --> 11:43.702
<i>ever since
the Advent of the Extraordinary,</i>

11:43.786 --> 11:46.205
<i>is obsessed with the power
that Midoriya now wields.</i>

11:47.415 --> 11:50.793
<i>Before this, Midoriya has encountered
Himiko Toga a few times,</i>

11:50.876 --> 11:53.921
<i>but she had never confessed
her feelings towards him,</i>

11:54.004 --> 11:57.550
<i>so he had no idea that Toga
had affection for him.</i>

11:58.926 --> 12:00.678
Boyfriend?

12:02.012 --> 12:04.181
What the hell are you talking about?

12:04.265 --> 12:06.976
<i>After all that's said and done,
he was just a damned nerd.</i>

12:08.602 --> 12:11.647
I like you. It was love at first sight.

12:12.356 --> 12:14.733
<i>You were bloody and beat up.</i>

12:15.526 --> 12:18.320
<i>You looked just like my first love.</i>

12:18.821 --> 12:21.073
<i>You're so cool, Izuku.</i>

12:25.536 --> 12:28.080
I want to be you.

12:29.123 --> 12:31.208
Let me suck your blood.

12:31.292 --> 12:33.377
Becoming a couple means

12:34.003 --> 12:37.715
going to amusement parks,
holding hands, and sharing a crepe.

12:40.926 --> 12:44.889
To me, becoming the person I like,
is what being a couple is.

12:45.890 --> 12:48.476
That's the only way
I can feel satisfaction.

12:48.559 --> 12:50.436
It's coming! Watch out!

12:53.898 --> 12:55.149
Hey, Hero.

12:56.108 --> 12:58.736
What do you want to do with me?

13:01.322 --> 13:05.493
What do you want to do with me?

13:06.827 --> 13:09.788
<i>It's happening again.
She's making her presence invisible.</i>

13:09.872 --> 13:12.208
<i>In this chaos,
we'll end up falling behind.</i>

13:12.833 --> 13:16.754
<i>My Danger Sense won't recognize her.
In a way, she's my nemesis.</i>

13:17.546 --> 13:19.131
I don't get you!

13:19.215 --> 13:23.135
I wanted to be strong like All Might,

13:24.178 --> 13:28.349
so I understand that trying to be like
someone you admire can be fulfilling.

13:29.099 --> 13:31.101
But why can't you also

13:31.185 --> 13:33.812
share the feelings of the person you love?

13:34.563 --> 13:38.317
I don't want to hurt the person I love.

13:44.406 --> 13:47.243
Why can't you be normal?

13:48.118 --> 13:49.870
<i>Please live a normal life.</i>

13:49.954 --> 13:54.083
The pitiful girl who killed herself due
to the oppression brought on by her Quirk.

13:54.166 --> 13:56.794
If you want to live as you please
and threaten others,

13:56.877 --> 13:59.213
then you have to take responsibility
for it!

14:03.092 --> 14:07.221
Izuku, you're just like Ochaco,

14:07.304 --> 14:09.848
just like Dad and Mom.

14:11.934 --> 14:15.604
Himiko Toga popped into my head
all of a sudden.

14:17.189 --> 14:19.984
<i>She looked very sad.</i>

14:20.734 --> 14:21.986
Only Heroes

14:22.069 --> 14:25.447
and the people the heroes protect
are considered "humans", huh?

14:27.658 --> 14:30.119
I guess we can never be together.

14:35.666 --> 14:36.876
Wait, Himiko Toga!

14:38.711 --> 14:41.547
I've been thinking of you
ever since I met you.

14:41.630 --> 14:44.800
I haven't thought about you. Not anymore.

14:44.884 --> 14:48.470
I held out hope for Izuku,
but I don't care anymore.

14:49.054 --> 14:50.347
Uraraka!

14:50.431 --> 14:52.099
If the world is going to reject me,

14:52.933 --> 14:54.685
then I will reject the world too.

14:57.396 --> 14:59.481
It's really sad, Ochaco.

15:02.318 --> 15:07.031
I thought you'd understand.
Because Ochaco,

15:07.114 --> 15:08.449
you and I both like the same...

15:12.161 --> 15:15.331
Asui... Froppy!

15:15.414 --> 15:16.707
Sorry I'm late.

15:16.790 --> 15:19.835
- Are you hurt?
- No, it's nothing but a scratch.

15:20.544 --> 15:23.589
We have to retrieve the knife.
My blood is on it.

15:24.465 --> 15:27.343
She's the most unpredictable opponent.

15:27.927 --> 15:31.221
The plan of transporting her
to an isolated island backfired.

15:32.765 --> 15:33.641
Tsuyu.

15:33.724 --> 15:35.768
Go, Deku.

15:35.851 --> 15:39.438
You can't waste your time here
talking about love.

15:39.521 --> 15:40.606
Just as planned,

15:40.689 --> 15:43.943
Uravity will take the lead here
since she knows Himiko Toga best.

15:44.860 --> 15:46.987
She and I will take her down.

15:48.906 --> 15:50.157
Deku,

15:51.659 --> 15:52.743
go to Shigaraki.

15:56.372 --> 15:59.667
Then I guess we're both weird.

16:02.378 --> 16:03.712
Uraraka.

16:05.547 --> 16:06.924
Let's do our best.

16:08.050 --> 16:12.137
It's so hard to live my life.
Why can't people understand my love?

16:12.721 --> 16:13.889
Go!

16:14.390 --> 16:17.142
<i>Activate Seventh's Float!</i>

16:17.226 --> 16:19.353
<i>Activate Third's Fa Jin!</i>

16:25.693 --> 16:27.987
<i>Air Force gives me
the driving force and balance.</i>

16:29.238 --> 16:30.114
<i>I'm too slow!</i>

16:30.781 --> 16:33.117
<i>There's nothing I can grab
with my Blackwhip!</i>

16:33.867 --> 16:37.121
<i>My Blackwhip and Faux 100 Percent
would get me there right away!</i>

16:38.455 --> 16:41.542
<i>Faster! I need to go faster!</i>

16:41.625 --> 16:43.210
You're panicking.

16:44.420 --> 16:45.671
It's clouding your judgment.

16:46.630 --> 16:48.173
Those reinforced parts

16:48.257 --> 16:51.593
can't withstand the entirety
of One For All's power.

16:52.302 --> 16:55.014
Are you planning to risk injury
before the actual battle?

16:55.889 --> 16:56.724
No.

16:57.307 --> 17:00.561
Or were you trying to use my Meta Ability?

17:01.395 --> 17:02.354
Yes.

17:02.938 --> 17:05.983
Didn't I tell you to save that
to use as a last resort?

17:07.026 --> 17:11.405
<i>As One For All became stronger,
so did all of our Meta Abilities.</i>

17:12.114 --> 17:16.285
<i>As a result, that power transformed
into something quite unique.</i>

17:17.036 --> 17:20.706
<i>It can no longer be wielded
in the same way I used to use it.</i>

17:21.290 --> 17:25.627
Don't act out of desperation.
This is a battle for our future.

17:26.670 --> 17:31.508
Trust your friends. They all have
their own motivation to fight.

17:32.134 --> 17:35.012
So you should just focus
on your own battle.

17:38.932 --> 17:41.393
- He's gone.
- I'm glad.

17:42.061 --> 17:44.938
Midoriya wouldn't have been able
to ignore her.

17:46.273 --> 17:50.319
<i>Plus, I can't bear the thought
of my friend's dearly held secret</i>

17:50.402 --> 17:51.987
<i>being revealed like that.</i>

17:53.739 --> 17:55.407
I've had enough.

17:55.491 --> 17:57.993
I love Izuku, Ochaco, and Tsuyu,

17:58.077 --> 18:01.330
but I've had enough.

18:01.914 --> 18:04.249
I want to be who I want to be.

18:04.333 --> 18:07.878
I just want to live a life
that is normal to me.

18:09.713 --> 18:11.882
<i>Right, Jin?</i>

18:13.675 --> 18:15.803
I'm Himiko Toga.

18:15.886 --> 18:19.556
I have no need for heroes.
So please be gone. Goodbye.

18:20.140 --> 18:21.558
No way!

18:21.642 --> 18:24.603
I will also live my life
the way I see fit!

18:24.686 --> 18:26.897
As Ochaco Uraraka!

18:27.648 --> 18:29.274
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY, OKUTO ISLAND
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA, CENTRAL HOSPITAL

18:29.358 --> 18:30.567
KAMINO WARD
CENTRAL HOSPITAL

18:31.485 --> 18:36.573
KANAGAWA PREFECTURE KAMINO WARD

18:36.657 --> 18:37.574
GROUND ZERO

18:37.658 --> 18:41.495
<i>The number of heroes was already
dwindling, but it's going down even more.</i>

18:42.329 --> 18:46.166
<i>The Nomu came, and now,
everything is up in flames.</i>

18:46.959 --> 18:50.879
<i>This reminds me of the other battle
not so long ago.</i>

18:54.716 --> 18:58.345
<i>I got into action after seeing
that battle in Hosu.</i>

19:01.390 --> 19:02.558
Shoto!

19:03.559 --> 19:06.395
It's hot! Unbelievably hot!

19:06.478 --> 19:09.189
I can't get any closer.
It'll ruin my engine.

19:09.773 --> 19:14.361
Oh, I'm sorry,
I was busy talking to myself.

19:14.444 --> 19:16.947
He's not here to see me, yet again,

19:17.030 --> 19:18.991
so I was a little bummed.

19:19.783 --> 19:22.244
He won't show up,

19:22.327 --> 19:25.497
and instead I get his third son
and three of his sidekicks.

19:25.581 --> 19:28.625
So this is his answer to me, huh?

19:29.334 --> 19:33.088
Go to hell with me, Enji Todoroki.

19:33.922 --> 19:36.550
Dance with me in hell.

19:37.176 --> 19:40.846
It's really unbelievable.

19:40.929 --> 19:43.599
Kido, stand back.

19:43.682 --> 19:46.101
You're not built to withstand the heat.

19:46.185 --> 19:50.147
No worries. I can change
the trajectory of all sorts of things.

19:50.230 --> 19:53.567
I'm fine as long as I manipulate
the trajectory of the wind around me.

19:53.650 --> 19:55.110
This is nothing new.

19:55.944 --> 19:58.238
<i>Being cool-headed and rational,</i>

19:58.322 --> 20:01.950
<i>that's how I've done it
for the last decade.</i>

20:02.618 --> 20:04.244
Just like always,

20:04.328 --> 20:07.706
I follow that man's orders
because I want to.

20:08.498 --> 20:11.793
That stinky old man's family relationship
may be in tatters,

20:11.877 --> 20:15.631
but that doesn't negate all the hard work
he has done to this day!

20:16.632 --> 20:19.218
That stinky man has entrusted you
with this.

20:19.301 --> 20:22.137
We will support you with all our might.

20:22.804 --> 20:24.806
Thank you, Burnin!

20:24.890 --> 20:27.309
No need to thank me. Save your energy.

20:28.727 --> 20:31.396
Toya... Dabi...

20:32.022 --> 20:33.523
Don't misunderstand.

20:34.024 --> 20:36.818
I'm not here because I was given
an order to be here.

20:37.653 --> 20:40.948
I'm here because I want to stop you.

20:41.615 --> 20:45.577
That means you've become
the pawn that Dad always wanted you to be.

20:46.495 --> 20:50.082
I guess so, if I was to ignore you
and continue being a hero.

20:51.041 --> 20:53.085
Right.

20:53.835 --> 20:57.673
<i>At the end of the day, this war
is between humans.</i>

20:57.756 --> 21:01.551
<i>It's not like soldiers were given orders
to begin this war.</i>

21:02.135 --> 21:06.556
<i>It's the result of each individual's
feelings exploding one after another.</i>

21:07.724 --> 21:11.478
<i>The desire to live freely,
to change society,</i>

21:12.396 --> 21:13.981
<i>or to destroy.</i>

21:14.690 --> 21:18.986
<i>The distortion and unbalance that's been
accepted and accumulated all over.</i>

21:19.569 --> 21:21.989
The limit of the society with superhumans.

21:22.072 --> 21:24.616
That's me... that's us.

21:26.451 --> 21:30.122
You were alive all this time.
Why didn't you come back?

21:31.707 --> 21:33.375
You really want to know?

21:34.543 --> 21:38.755
Then I'll let you know.
I am your older brother after all.

21:40.924 --> 21:43.218
I'll tell you how I became Dabi,

21:43.802 --> 21:46.722
the reason why I was able
to burn hotter than you

21:46.805 --> 21:49.641
and continue living until now.

23:21.942 --> 23:22.943
<i>Preview of the next episode.</i>

23:23.527 --> 23:26.071
<i>Kamino Ward in Kanagawa Prefecture.
Ground Zero.</i>

23:26.571 --> 23:30.867
<i>It's where All Might and All For One
waged a long battle.</i>

23:30.951 --> 23:33.495
<i>Now, it's where Todoroki and Dabi
will face each other.</i>

23:34.121 --> 23:37.499
<i>There will be flames that burn everything.</i>

23:37.582 --> 23:41.378
<i>There will be flames
to recover all that was lost.</i>

23:41.461 --> 23:44.172
<i>Next episode, "Two Flashfires."</i>

23:44.256 --> 23:46.925
<i>Two flames will scorch even life itself.</i>

23:47.926 --> 23:50.428
<i>Go Beyond. Plus Ultra!</i>
